Problem 1: The Cargo Hold
You are managing a starship's cargo inventory for a planetary expedition.

    Create an ArrayList of strings called cargo.

    Add these exact initial items: "Warp Hypercore", "Tritium", "Carbon", "Ferrite Dust", "Tritium".

    Write the logic to search the list for all instances of "Tritium" and replace them with "Di-hydrogen".

    Remove the item sitting at the very last index of the list.

    Print the final cargo list using a standard forward for loop.

    import java.util.ArrayList;
    import java.util.Collections;
    class Main{
        public static void main(String[] args){
            ArrayList<String> cargo = new ArrayList<>();
            cargo.add("Warp Hypercore");
            cargo.add("Tritium");
            cargo.add("Carbon");
            cargo.add("Ferrite Dust");
            cargo.add("Tritium");
            for(int i= cargo.size()-1;i>=0;i--){
                if(cargo.get(i).equals("Tritium"))
                {
                    cargo.set(i,"Di-hydrogen");
                }
            }

            cargo.remove(cargo.size()-1);
        for(int i=0;i<=cargo.size()-1;i++){
            System.out.println(cargo.get(i));
        }

        }
    }





Problem 2: The Ghat Route Logger
You are logging the continuous distances (in kilometers) between stops on a long-distance Honda Activa 125 ride through the Agumbe and Charmadi ghats.

    Create an ArrayList of integers called routeLog.

    Add these distance stretches: 45, 112, 30, 85, 12, 60.

    Write the logic to calculate and print the total combined distance of the ride.

    Write the logic to remove any individual stretch that is strictly less than 50 km.

    Print the updated list showing only the long-distance stretches remaining.

    import java.util.*;
    class Main{
        public static void main(String[] args){
            ArrayList<Integer> routeLog = new ArrayList<>();
            routeLog.add(45);
            routeLog.add(112);
            routeLog.add(30);
            routeLog.add(85);
            routeLog.add(12);
            routeLog.add(60);
            int total =0;
            for(int i=0;i<=routeLog.size()-1;i++){
                total = total + routeLog.get(i) ;
            }
            System.out.println("Total distance combined: "+total);
            for(int i=routeLog.size()-1;i>=0;i--){
                if(routeLog.get(i)<50)
                {
                    routeLog.remove(i);
                }
            }
            System.out.println("Long Distance stretches");
            for(Integer longroute : routeLog){
                System.out.println(longroute);
            }
        }
    }
